.nh
.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-app-log-get - Live progress log of the latest app install (step changes, server log tail)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server app log get  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Live progress log of the latest app install (step changes, server log tail)

.PP
Lines with \fBid\fR greater than \fBafter\fR, oldest first (poll with the last id you have). \fBsource\fR is step, server, system or staff. Server lines are untrusted text sent by the server (secrets masked); render them as plain text.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/servers/{id}/app/log (operationId getAppInstallLog, scope cloud_read)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--after\fP=0

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for get

.PP
\fB--param-limit\fP=0


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-server-app-log(1)\fP
